window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Given an impossible task by the Angels, Xandra takes the first step in completing it when she travels to the Fae realm to protect the one man she would like to kill herself. </p> <p>Along the way, she discovers that Kallen has been keeping yet another secret from her - one that could tear them apart forever. Will she stay with him, or will she fall into the arms of another? </p>"; 
